<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Norfolk Southern raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Norfolk Southern raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal and Co said analyst Steve Lewins upgraded Norfolk Southern Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said sees shares as a &quot;core&quot; holding suitable for all accounts.</p>
<p>-- said expects a stock split &quot;before long.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares were off 5/8 at 94-3/4.</p>
</text>
